      "body": "Hi [FirstName],\n\nI came across [Company] and was impressed by the work you're doing — especially [specific detail].\n\nI'm reaching out because we've helped marketing teams at companies like yours cut their outreach cycle by 40% using smarter automation. I'd love to understand if that's a challenge you're currently facing.\n\nWould it be worth a quick 15-minute chat this week?\n\nBest,\nJordan Davies\nHead of Marketing, ACME Corp",
