      "whenToUse": "Send 3 days after initial outreach with no reply.",
      "body": "Hi [FirstName],\n\nJust wanted to float my previous message to the top of your inbox — I know how busy things get.\n\nI genuinely think there's a fit here. One of our clients, similar to [Company], reduced their lead response time from 48 hours to under 4 hours after working with us.\n\nHappy to send over a short case study if that would be helpful, or jump on a quick call at your convenience.\n\nThanks,\nJordan",
