      "whenToUse": "Final follow-up. Send 7 days after first email. Keep it light.",
      "body": "Hi [FirstName],\n\nI don't want to flood your inbox, so this will be my last follow-up for now.\n\nI wanted to share a quick win from a [Company industry] client: they generated 3x more qualified leads in their first month using our platform. I thought it might resonate.\n\nIf the timing isn't right, no worries at all — feel free to reach out whenever it makes sense. I'll be here.\n\nBest,\nJordan Davies\nACME Corp",
